PARSFILE
#FullDataName Procedures`Off-Road Driving`Driving
#CheckBox3 0    

#RingCtrl0 2
#RingCtrl1 1
OPT_STOP 1
TSTART 0
SSTART -40
TSTART_WRITE = TSTART;
TSTOP 15
SSTOP 40
OPT_DIRECTION 0
*TSTOP 15
*TSTART 0
*SSTART -40
*SSTOP 40

INSTALL_DRIVER_SPEED_CONTROLLER CarSim9
OPT_SC 2
PARSFILE Control\Driver\StrDM_5e1b87df-4a9a-4a60-ac80-544adfa4667d.par
#BlueLink27 Control: Steering by the Closed-loop Driver Model`No Offset, 1 sec. Preview` Constant Position` , Steering`StrDM_5e1b87df-4a9a-4a60-ac80-544adfa4667d

PARSFILE Control\Braking\PbkCon_bf4961f4-c4cf-4b18-a8f7-5f65e31ecd3f.par
#BlueLink28 Control: Braking MC Pressure (Open Loop)`Constant: 0 MPa` Constant` , Braking`PbkCon_bf4961f4-c4cf-4b18-a8f7-5f65e31ecd3f

PARSFILE Control\Gear_at\GearCL_c9d9bfad-9d47-4974-82bf-69ae78daa70e.par
#BlueLink30 Control: Shifting (Closed Loop)`MT 1st Mode` ` , Shifting Control`GearCL_c9d9bfad-9d47-4974-82bf-69ae78daa70e

PARSFILE Control\Speed_t\SpdTime_e6c774fc-69ba-42af-86a4-171a7400110d.par
#BlueLink31 Control: Speed (Closed Loop) Using Target Speed`18 km/h` Constant Speed` , Speed vs. time`SpdTime_e6c774fc-69ba-42af-86a4-171a7400110d

#MiscYellow0
iside 1
z_profile_gain 2.5
iside 2
z_profile_gain 2.5
#ENDMYellow

PARSFILE Roads\3D_Road\Road_aa58e20f-f7b5-4c48-8972-9b50658df599.par
#BlueLink0 Road: 3D Surface (All Properties)`Hilly Off-Road` Off-Road` , Miscellaneous`Road_aa58e20f-f7b5-4c48-8972-9b50658df599

PARSFILE Roads\Profiles\Profile_3bff0c88-84c1-408a-843d-956a1e2abe43.par
#BlueLink1 Surface: Roughness Profiles`Example Road Roughness` ` , Miscellaneous`Profile_3bff0c88-84c1-408a-843d-956a1e2abe43

PARSFILE Plot\Setup\Plot_2f48d77f-b760-4fab-a2c0-0fa2004b8b4f.par
